{"title":"Bernini’s Ratto di Proserpina","link":"https://kottke.org/25/06/berninis-ratto-di-proserpina","date":1749315079000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/IMG_2459.jpeg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/IMG_2459.jpeg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/IMG_2459.jpeg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"3213\" height=\"5712\" alt=\"IMG_2459.jpeg\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/IMG_2454.jpeg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/IMG_2454.jpeg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/IMG_2454.jpeg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"3213\" height=\"5712\" alt=\"IMG_2454.jpeg\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/IMG_2452.jpeg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/IMG_2452.jpeg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/IMG_2452.jpeg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2268\" height=\"4032\" alt=\"IMG_2452.jpeg\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/IMG_2453.jpeg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/IMG_2453.jpeg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/IMG_2453.jpeg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"3213\" height=\"5712\" alt=\"IMG_2453.jpeg\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/IMG_2485.jpeg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/IMG_2485.jpeg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/IMG_2485.jpeg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2268\" height=\"4032\" alt=\"IMG_2485.jpeg\" /></p>\n\n<p>I’m in Rome with my family to celebrate a milestone. We went to the Borghese Gallery this morning and I got to see my favorite sculpture, <a href=\"https://www.collezionegalleriaborghese.it/en/opere/rape-of-proserpine\">Bernini’s Ratto di Proserpina</a>. A masterpiece. The photos both do and do not do it justice — so grateful to get to see it in person.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Bernini\">Bernini</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Rome\">Rome</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/sculpture\">sculpture</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/travel\">travel</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/06/berninis-ratto-di-proserpina\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"36ca66aa5158ec44a4c3bde77a7b1e52c185db0189deea1f1160dab12ef9b496","category":"Sites"}